Chemical Enrichment:

Particle Type: ityp & use_particle_type
	Types
	 0: DM
	 1: sink particle for AGNs (reserved)
	-2: Pop II star particle with SN progenitors
	 2: Pop II star particle after SNe
	-3: Pop III star before explosion or implosion (reserved) 
	 3: Pop III star after (reserved)
	 5: sink particle for stars (reserved)

